 * The instrument chrome every demo sits in, in five fixed zones: the header
 * says whether it's live or mid-flight, the body shows the thing being
 * observed, the deck holds the controls, and the footer reports what the
 * server actually did. If a panel can't honestly fill its readout, it
 * doesn't belong on this page.
 */
